{
  "label": "ramen10",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label ramen10:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I walk into the ramen shop to be met with an...unusual sight.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s by no means uncommon to see other people here at this time of night. In fact, Tojo Ramen is actually surprisingly popular given its size and location.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But...I can’t really say I expected to see Kaori of all people here. Let alone a particularly angry looking Kaori.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Isn’t she normally working around this time?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just how many places can she be at once?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why will you not listen to my proposal?! Do your human ears not function?! Is the spider to blame?!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We are not hiring, but thank you for your interest in Tojo Ramen.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please do not come here anymore.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": May I at least speak with the human who owns this noodle building?!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He is sick and bedridden. He can barely speak.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He does not need to speak! He just needs to listen!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is there a problem here?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori2.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Hello again.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome to Tojo Ramen.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please take your time looking over the menu and let me know if you have any questions.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if kaoridate1 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Friend?! What are you doing here?!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hamburger Man?! What are you doing here?!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you two know each other?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We do. In fact, I feel like I run into her pretty much everywhere I go.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you know how to make her go away?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have not yet even swallowed a single dough string!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She keeps calling my precious noodles dough strings.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am tempted to slap a bitch.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I move several steps closer to the two of them and take a seat at the counter next to Kaori.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see you learned another new phrase.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Be quiet or I will slap you as well.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My fury can not be quelled.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well at least you aren’t hiding a knife behind your back this time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo, don’t even think about it. Remember the tag line.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tojo Ramen. All of the flavor, none of the violence.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There you go. I knew you had it in you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All I have in me is rage.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And noodles. Yes, I know.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Make her hire me! Please!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why? You have like seven jobs already.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is not even enough jobs to cover every day of the week!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Yes it is?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I require additional occupations!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Tsuneyo?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will you give Kaori a job?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have exhausted every possible effort.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It looks like you’ll just need to find another job elsewhere.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will not forget this betrayal.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just be quiet and eat your dough-strings.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You bastard. You will pay.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are both fortunate that my stomach is lonely and has not absorbed hot pork liquid in a very long time.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's it. I’m calling the police.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one is calling the police.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo, why don’t you take a break for a little while and sit with the two of us?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am working.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right. Which is exactly why I said “Take a break.”",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But you haven’t ordered anything yet. I will not be able to provide adequate service if you decide to do so while I am on the break you suggested.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s fine. I'm not really hungry anyway. I just came here to talk to you for a bit.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do not fall for his trap! This man sells girls your age on the black market!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kaori, stop going on about that human trafficking thing. I told you it wasn’t true.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No! I am very mad at you!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": After all we’ve been through...you want to sell me?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course I don’t want to sell you...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you really believe this suspicious character over me?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know what to believe. Everyone is calling my noodles dough strings and it is pushing my mind into turmoil.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then how about you just take a seat and eat some noodles? That always helps, doesn’t it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori11.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh...noodles.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There you go. Doesn’t that calm you down?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It does.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am very easily swayed.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll try to forget that when my motives become slightly more inappropriate.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori12.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is this sorcery? All you did was tell her to think of dough strings and it is as if she's journeyed to another world.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not sorcery. I’ve just learned how to talk to her.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s right, Tsuneyo. Noodles.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe I will take a break...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just for a bit.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo begins to make herself a bowl of ramen and appears to completely forget Kaori's existence for the time being.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori13.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why will you not partake in the consumption of a bowl of pork warmth?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it because you only eat hamburgers?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, Kaori. I’m just not hungry.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if kaoridate1 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori14.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you may share mine if you change your mind.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am no longer mad at you. And we are friends now, so it is okay.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you, Kaori. That’s...very sweet of you. I’m really okay, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should consume more carbohydrates so you can run longer distances.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...not a thing I want to do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Share my dough strings. I can not finish them all.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it because you think the dough strings look like worms?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...No?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I also think they look like worms. But I will gladly consume them and become stronger.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You do that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori15.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have returned.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo plops a bowl of ramen onto the counter that is so large that I can feel the wood slant down a few centimeters due to the sudden increase in weight.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you really eat all of that?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Any less than this would not quiet the rage burning within me.",
