      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fuck you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo, just because you know that isn’t a curse anymore doesn’t mean that it’s okay to say it to your friends.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're not my friend. You aren't anything to me.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What happened to that “After all we’ve been through” stuff from a few minutes ago?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I meant through all of the transactions. There have been several now.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if kaoridate1 == True:",
