      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like other foods too much anyway. Like bratwurst! Or soda!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Soda isn’t a food, Kaori.",
