    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori16.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do not tell me how to live my life when you love nothing.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Go on, Sensei. Tell her you love noodles.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Make me proud.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles are good, don’t get me wrong, but I don’t think I’d put them at the top of my list.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori17.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You will regret these words.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, why do you both look like you’re about to kill me? I don't like this.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this what “leading someone on” means? I read about this in a book once.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If these so-called “noodles” are not included in your favorite human items, what are?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is there nothing you find sacred in this world?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori18.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": List the things you love!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The things I love, huh?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, we’ve already crossed off noodles. So that leaves what?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t love my job.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t love Kumon-mi.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I care a lot for some, if not all, of the girls I’ve met here...but is it really fair to call something as trivial as that love?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Even with everything I’ve gone through, I still feel like some sort of outsider when I’m told to list the things that are important to me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In fact, there are so few of them that there's really no point in making a list at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To be honest...I don’t think I love anything.",
