    {
      "en": ": If you tell me that savior is noodles, I’m going to walk out of this restaurant right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Perhaps it is best if I keep my mouth shut.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You did not name a single furry creature in your list of beloved items.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You aren’t human at all, are you?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shouldn’t we be the ones asking you that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m the most human person here. Neither of you voiced how you feel about animals. Humans are supposed to like animals.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo loves animals.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
