      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori20.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least you are not completely lost to the darkness, Pork Woman. There is hope for you yet.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pork Woman?",
