      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I take back all of the mean things I said to you. I require your protection.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have consumed too many dough-strings to be able to properly engage in combat with a girl as shapely and athletic and beautiful as her.",
