      "en": "scene tsuneyokaori23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori23.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori23"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you. I think you are beautiful as well.",
