      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyokaori25.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyokaori25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whatever you say, bro.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Many years, I have lived. 154 Dog years to be exact. But never in my life have I been so out of place in one restaurant.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This side of town is pure evil.",
